# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# READ THIS BEFORE YOU PUSH A FORK
#
# The Context/ pack files — school-profile.md, my-profile.md, teaching-beliefs.md,
# writing-style.md and anything you save into Context/curriculum/ — are TRACKED in
# this repo. Adding them to this file later does NOT untrack them: .gitignore only
# affects files git is not already following. So if you fork, fill them with your
# real school detail and push, you publish them.
#
# For most people that is fine — there is no student data in those files. If it is
# not fine for you, do one of these BEFORE your first push:
#
#   * Keep filled-in versions in Context/private/ (ignored above), or
#   * untrack them, then add the paths to this file, or
#   * never add a remote. Local git still gives you an undo.
